OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 11 APR
OL,4,G0600FSounds of the 60s with Tony
OL,5,     FBlackburn
OL,6,     GTony brings you two hours of
OL,7,     Gmusic from the best decade ever,
OL,8,     Gwith hits from Barbara Lewis, Roy
OL,9,     GOrbison and Andy Williams. This
OL,10,     Gweek, the top three comes from
OL,11,     G1962.
OL,12,G0800FDermot O'Leary
OL,13,     GComedian & podcaster James
OL,14,     GAcaster is in the studio. Plus, a
OL,15,     Gwedding and The Mystery Voice. To
OL,16,     Glisten on most smart speakers
OL,17,     Gjust say 'Ask BBC Sounds to play
OL,18,     GDermot O'Leary'.
